WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:03,490
Don't point your fingers randomly

2
00:00:04,490 --> 00:00:08,580
Your son was there that day, right? He didn’t tell you.

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:11,580
What will happen if we hand over all the supplies and down jackets?

4
00:00:11,580 --> 00:00:12,580
More than 50 degrees below zero

5
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,780
No clothes, no supplies

6
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:14,980
Do you think he can come back alive?

7
00:00:17,310 --> 00:00:18,310
I can do it without removing it

8
00:00:18,510 --> 00:00:19,710
Point at my nose and curse again

9
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:28,340
It won't be so simple next time. Wait.

10
00:00:30,050 --> 00:00:31,450
They didn't pry open my house last night

11
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,250
That's why you get two

12
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:34,450
stuck under door handle

13
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,850
It will form support after opening

14
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,650
It's very difficult to open and remove from the outside.

15
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:41,930
This lock is good

16
00:00:41,930 --> 00:00:42,930
two locks

17
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:43,930
One for the door

18
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:45,530
Perfect for a bedroom

19
00:00:48,910 --> 00:00:53,050
It's time to clean up. Get my Lee online.

20
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,250
I think the group of people last night

21
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:55,250
Will come again tonight

22
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:56,650
I'll give you this walkie-talkie

23
00:00:56,650 --> 00:00:57,650
tune the same channel

24
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:58,650
If you have anything, come to me directly
